            "icon_size": 64,
            "title": "This book is for people who design decisions into products:",
            "text": "<p>Product designers<br/>UX designers<br/>UI designers<br/>Product managers<br/>Growth designers<br/>Founders building conversion-focused products<br/>Teams using the Persuasive Patterns card deck and wanting deeper guidance</p><p>The book is explicitly intended for product designers who want to enhance their work through applied psychology, while complementing the card deck with deeper explanations and practical use.</p>",
